  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Aura at rank eight spreads. After a recital about wind, dust, flowers, and the sorrow of myriad ages, everlasting sorrow fills several li: sorrow, dejection, and other negative emotions strike both sides, and Fang clan’s six Immortal Gu Houses shake. The watching immortals identify her as Wan clan’s strongest peak rank eight, who lived for ten thousand years, created Myriad Age Building, and is the only one who cultivates both time path and wisdom path to use that move through the house. When she was alive, Wan clan almost dominated the whole of Western Desert. Fang clan retreats in defeat, then the alliance army gives chase under Myriad Age Building’s lead.",
      "chapters": [
        2260
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_fang_clan",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "fac_wan_clan",
        "house_myriad_age_building",
        "reg_western_desert"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She wears a white garment, her hair is silvery white, and she looks quite old.",
      "chapters": [
        2261
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Xiao Ye Hu finds her on the main seat in a white garment, silvery white hair, looking quite old, with Wan Hao Guang and Wan Xiao at her sides. After Fang clan’s defeat she presses the anti-Fang alliance to keep attacking. That same day she announces the establishment of the new anti-Fang alliance, and she is now its alliance leader.",
      "chapters": [
        2261
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
